bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - OCR detect + extract text

control "Router" as Router
control "Python OCR Service" as Python
control "Ollama Vision (qwen2.5vl:7b)" as Ollama

Router -> Python: 1. Send image + client_w=900
activate Router
activate Python

Python -> Python: 2. Decode image (OpenCV)
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python -> Python: 3. Resize to width=900 (keep ratio)
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python -> Ollama: 4. Send image + prompt
activate Ollama

opt Ollama error / timeout
    Ollama --> Python: 4.1. No response
    Python --> Router: 4.2. Return error
    Router --> Router: 4.3. Handle error\
    activate Router
    space
    deactivate Router
end

Ollama --> Python: 5. Raw JSON response
deactivate Ollama

Python -> Python: 6. Extract JSON (clean response)
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python -> Python: 7. Parse bbox + text
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python --> Router: 8. Return bubbles {x,y,w,h,text}
deactivate Python

Router -> Python: 9. Send image + coords + client_w=900
activate Python

Python -> Python: 10. Decode image
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python -> Python: 11. Compute scale ratio
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python -> Python: 12. Convert coords
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python -> Python: 13. Crop region
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

opt Invalid crop
    Python --> Router: 13.1. Return error
end

Python -> Ollama: 14. Send cropped image + prompt
activate Ollama

opt Ollama error / timeout
    Ollama --> Python: 14.1. No response
    Python --> Router: 14.2. Return error
end

Ollama --> Python: 15. Extracted text
deactivate Ollama

Python -> Python: 16. Trim text
activate Python
space
deactivate Python

Python --> Router: 17. Return {text}
deactivate Python
deactivate Router